  "title": "Walmart Expands Tap-to-Pay Support",
  "summary": "Walmart has officially started accepting Apple Pay and Google Pay in selected locations by August 24, 2026, with plans to expand to all US stores and gas stations by the end of the year. This marks a significant step in supporting digital payments in the retail sector.",
